  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UPFI 3 East: Urban Project Facility in the Neighbourhood - Eastern Neighbourhood Window</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The project aims at addressing urban challenges in Armenia, Azerbaijan, Georgia, Moldova and Ukraine. Building on identified urban development needs and climate change-related challenges, the UPFI 3 East Facility&#xbf;s rationale is to accelerate the implementation of a common strategic vision for sustainable urban development in the respective countries of the Eastern Neighbourhood.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
